Package: oralDiseasePrediction
Title: Cross-cohort prediction of dental caries and periodontal disease
Version: 1.0.0
Description: Version pinning for the R side of the analysis. Not an installable
    package; this file records the exact versions on which every reported number was
    produced. The same versions are checked at run time by R/00_data.R, which
    stops if they differ.
Depends:
    R (== 4.6.0)
Imports:
    MMUPHin (== 1.20.0),
    Maaslin2 (== 1.26.0),
    metafor (== 5.0.1),
    vegan (== 2.7.5),
    ggplot2 (== 4.0.3),
    ggrepel (== 0.9.8),
    dplyr (== 1.2.1),
    svglite (== 2.2.2)
